+- **295 audit lines:** `lines-check.mjs` reads `fa90c3a41^` (before the 2026-11-01 move) and compares with `ai/sessions` today. 19 files, 72 lines; 17 identical in the store; 55 rewritten in the store (task stubs point at real task folders that exist; the rest match by content). Missing: 0. The only line without a text match is the `v-js3vqn5` session start, and that session has its own record at `sessions/2026/10/12/v-js3vqn5/session.jsonl`. Nothing needed restoring.
