+- **Old addresses:** inline script in `public/index.html` (works on the static host). `check.mjs` / `urls.mjs` show `/framework/ai2/`, `/needs/`, `/log/`, a dated card and a session folder all land on a real page. 531 card `page.jsonl` still say `"class": "/framework/ai2/card.js"`, mapped in `core/Page/Jsonl.js` (found by the second review: the card page broke without it).
+- **Dead `ai/` folders** (not moved): see §4 of `../ai2-and-ai-folders/findings.md`.
